<speak>Yes, there is a lady who walks a very small dog with a very big personality. The dog always stops at the same corner and seems to expect everybody to greet it. I know the dog's name, but I am embarrassed to say I still do not know the lady's name. We have been saying good morning for months. One day I will have to introduce myself properly instead of continuing this arrangement where the dog is the only one with a name.</speak>